WEBVTT

00:02.464 --> 00:04.764
shinjitai
I want to believe

00:04.904 --> 00:07.924
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light that I found that day

00:08.434 --> 00:11.174
kimi to kawashita
Because I still have

00:11.174 --> 00:15.804
tatta hitotsuno yakusoku ga arukara
That one promise that I made to you

00:16.244 --> 00:23.204
mou tachidomarazuni aruite yukitai
I want to keep walking, never stopping

00:24.954 --> 00:27.824
Dragon Drive

00:27.824 --> 00:33.314
uresugita kajitsu wo kajiru youni
Like biting into an overripe fruit

00:33.464 --> 00:36.434
yowai jibun ni
I was spoiling myself

00:36.434 --> 00:39.664
amaetsuzukete ita
I was giving in to my weakness

00:40.174 --> 00:44.544
kimi ni deawanakereba
If I hadn't met you

00:44.544 --> 00:46.504
ima mo
I'd still...

00:46.504 --> 00:52.814
kabe wo kowasu koto nado dekinakatta yo
...be unable to break the walls around me

00:54.554 --> 00:56.924
wasurenai
I'll never forget

00:56.924 --> 01:00.114
ano hi kanjita itami
The pain that I felt that day

01:00.454 --> 01:05.464
nido to ano basho modoritakunai
I never want to go back to that place

01:05.464 --> 01:07.024
motto tsuyoku
This strong feeling

01:07.164 --> 01:09.564
shinjitai
I want to believe

01:09.564 --> 01:12.694
ano hi mitsuketa hikari
In the light I found that day

01:13.104 --> 01:18.174
kakkowarui to warawaretemo ii
Let them laugh and call me a loser

01:18.174 --> 01:20.914
bukiyou dakara
Because I'm clumsy

01:20.914 --> 01:28.574
onaji ikikata shika erabenainda
I can only choose to live life this way

01:42.434 --> 01:46.124
Gholaoh and I can fight in our own way!

02:00.054 --> 02:01.714
He's strong.

02:02.414 --> 02:03.474
I am Mukai!

02:04.524 --> 02:07.684
Thirteenth generation lord
of the honorable Gizaya Clan.

02:08.354 --> 02:11.624
The Dragonite is now as good as mine.

02:13.734 --> 02:16.924
The Gathering

02:28.444 --> 02:30.244
You want water?

02:32.244 --> 02:34.914
Well, I kinda want some,
but maybe I don't.

02:35.214 --> 02:36.984
- Which is it?!
- We'll have some!

02:38.954 --> 02:40.584
What a lousy customer.

02:40.894 --> 02:43.354
She's kind of rude.

02:45.464 --> 02:49.864
Yaudim is the most dangerous place
in this area.

02:50.164 --> 02:52.494
They're especially unfriendly to strangers.

02:58.644 --> 02:59.364
I see.

03:00.544 --> 03:01.704
Listen, Reiji.

03:02.314 --> 03:04.904
If someone tries to pick a fight with you,
just ignore him!

03:05.444 --> 03:08.614
Even I can't fight
against a hundred people at once.

03:09.184 --> 03:12.624
What kinda fight grows big enough
to involve one hundred people?

03:15.154 --> 03:18.324
How much longer are you going
to carry around that "Rin-Rin"...

03:18.324 --> 03:20.934
- Is that really a dragon?!
- Yes, she's a dragon!

03:20.934 --> 03:24.124
And she's my friend,
so don't treat her like she's some outsider!

03:24.364 --> 03:25.334
Right?

03:26.064 --> 03:31.064
The city where she lived
was destroyed by Guan-Coo of Yaudim!

03:31.774 --> 03:33.864
Even though they did nothing wrong!

03:37.184 --> 03:38.744
It's just too cruel.

03:38.744 --> 03:42.054
The more I hear of him,
the more I'm convinced...

03:42.054 --> 03:43.914
...this Guan-Coo is a terrible guy!

03:44.424 --> 03:45.714
Let's go and beat him up.

03:46.054 --> 03:47.294
Wait a minute.

03:47.294 --> 03:48.724
I hope you remember why you're here!

03:49.224 --> 03:50.394
What's the big deal?

03:50.394 --> 03:52.024
Our first match isn't until tomorrow.

03:52.324 --> 03:53.884
Evil guys need to be taught a lesson!

03:54.064 --> 03:55.534
Come on, kid.

03:55.834 --> 03:59.094
Do you know who you'll be fighting
in the Dragonic Heaven?

03:59.534 --> 04:00.404
Nope.

04:00.404 --> 04:01.704
You amaze me.

04:02.204 --> 04:03.394
This guy! Here!

04:03.604 --> 04:05.034
"Match opponent."

04:05.544 --> 04:08.374
"Magna, age 33, single."

04:08.374 --> 04:09.214
Oops.

04:09.214 --> 04:10.514
My mistake.

04:10.514 --> 04:11.844
This guy, we don't need to worry about.

04:11.844 --> 04:15.414
Not him, but there's this other guy
who's really strong.

04:15.414 --> 04:16.514
This is him!

04:17.924 --> 04:21.444
The champion of the previous
Dragonic Heaven, Sun Wols!

04:22.354 --> 04:23.864
This guy's...

04:23.864 --> 04:25.884
...the previous champion?

04:26.194 --> 04:27.164
That's right.

04:27.164 --> 04:29.754
In other words,
the strongest of dragon masters.

04:30.064 --> 04:31.124
Got it?

04:32.564 --> 04:35.474
We're gonna have to face off
against this guy.

04:36.104 --> 04:39.134
He's not an opponent you can beat
by fighting with ordinary methods!

04:39.504 --> 04:41.844
Then this Sun Wols guy is strong.

04:42.174 --> 04:43.114
Of course.

04:43.114 --> 04:45.514
Then we've gotta give it 120 percent!

04:45.514 --> 04:46.484
Right!

04:46.584 --> 04:48.954
So, where can we find
this Guan-Coo fellow?!

04:48.954 --> 04:51.724
You still don't get it!

04:51.724 --> 04:52.984
Come with me!

04:52.984 --> 04:54.394
Ouch! Owww...

04:54.394 --> 04:55.694
W-Wait a minute!

04:55.694 --> 04:58.294
- I said wait for me!
- Ouch, ouch, ouch...

04:58.294 --> 05:00.884
- Are you listening to me?! Wait!
- Owww!

05:09.274 --> 05:13.714
So this is where
the Dragonic Heaven will take place.

05:13.714 --> 05:14.674
Yeah!

05:14.914 --> 05:16.904
This is our battlefield.

05:17.344 --> 05:19.944
This is where we can't lose,
no matter what.

05:21.454 --> 05:25.884
You haven't forgotten why we've come
all the way out here, have you?

05:26.224 --> 05:27.384
Sure, I remember.

05:27.694 --> 05:29.984
To protect the Dragonite from RI-ON, right?

05:30.124 --> 05:31.154
That's right.

05:31.364 --> 05:32.894
By achieving that, we can save Rikyu...

05:32.894 --> 05:35.954
...and send you guys back
to the world you came from.

05:36.394 --> 05:37.364
Yeah.

05:38.234 --> 05:42.334
Well, I personally couldn't care less
about any of that.

05:57.884 --> 06:00.454
If that bastard makes an appearance...

06:00.454 --> 06:03.284
...I'll probably lose it,
and forget it's a match.

06:04.924 --> 06:06.924
When that time comes, I'm trusting you...

06:06.924 --> 06:09.424
...to take care of the Dragonite, Reiji.

06:09.764 --> 06:11.664
We've come this far, Chibi.

06:13.304 --> 06:15.294
Let's win every Dragonic Heaven match...

06:15.434 --> 06:18.104
...and be sure to get our hands
on the Dragonite.

06:25.784 --> 06:27.714
I cannot stand this place any longer!

06:27.714 --> 06:29.014
Stop complaining!

06:30.114 --> 06:33.384
If we stand out too much now,
we may be attacked before our match.

06:33.794 --> 06:35.584
These drab lodgings are part of my plan.

06:35.994 --> 06:37.614
Plan, you say.

06:37.924 --> 06:41.154
If it's luxury you want,
I'll give it to you soon enough.

06:41.664 --> 06:44.564
As soon as I get the Dragonite.

06:44.804 --> 06:45.994
We'll be looking forward to it.

06:48.304 --> 06:49.994
Um, Lord Mukai?

06:50.374 --> 06:51.234
What is it?

06:51.574 --> 06:53.244
Well, where is this Dragonite...

06:53.244 --> 06:58.044
...which only the winner
of the Dragonic Heaven can see?

07:03.284 --> 07:06.324
If we could get a glimpse
of the real Dragonite...

07:06.324 --> 07:09.254
...I think it could help
increase our motivation.

07:09.754 --> 07:12.814
Sounds legitimate, but could you actually
be thinking of stealing it?

07:12.994 --> 07:14.534
S-Steal it?!

07:14.534 --> 07:18.124
I would never do anything
so crass and uncivilized!

07:21.304 --> 07:23.434
The location of the Dragonite...

07:24.004 --> 07:25.594
...is known only to the championship team.

07:25.844 --> 07:27.334
Nobody knows?

07:27.514 --> 07:29.604
But the champions will be able
to see it, right?

07:30.614 --> 07:32.044
The Dragonite is placed in a shrine...

07:33.184 --> 07:35.854
...and only the champions
of the Dragonic Heaven...

07:35.854 --> 07:40.784
...who have received the ceremony of honor
from the priests are allowed to enter.

07:41.094 --> 07:43.494
And where is this shrine?

07:44.494 --> 07:47.934
Only the championship team
knows the location of the shrine.

07:48.264 --> 07:49.624
"Ceremony of honor"...

07:50.064 --> 07:51.264
That's right.

07:51.734 --> 07:56.434
That in itself is the ultimate honor,
provided only to the winners.

08:01.114 --> 08:03.074
If you wish to lay hands on the Dragonite...

08:03.074 --> 08:06.014
...you have no choice but to become
the Dragonic Heaven champion.

08:06.714 --> 08:07.914
Understand?

08:09.454 --> 08:12.484
So if I become champion
and am able to enter the shrine...

08:12.484 --> 08:14.684
...the Dragonite will be mine.

08:15.654 --> 08:16.794
That's all?

08:16.794 --> 08:18.694
It sounds a lot easier than I imagined.

08:19.994 --> 08:22.034
It all begins tomorrow.

08:22.034 --> 08:24.154
Right now, I am tired.

08:25.604 --> 08:28.774
This is all for the sake of the Dragonite.

08:28.774 --> 08:30.434
Endure this, Sayaka.

08:31.874 --> 08:33.044
Reiji Ohzora.

08:33.044 --> 08:37.304
Are you also in this city somewhere?

08:39.814 --> 08:42.014
I wonder where the previous champion is.

08:42.014 --> 08:43.714
He looks so handsome.

08:43.714 --> 08:45.984
- I'd love to meet him.
- You fool!

08:45.984 --> 08:48.854
You can't expect him
to be casually strolling the streets!

08:48.854 --> 08:50.914
He's everyone's target, you know!

08:51.024 --> 08:53.014
He's being targeted?

08:53.394 --> 08:55.494
You don't even know that much?

08:55.494 --> 08:59.954
If you beat the strongest guy,
then you become the strongest.

09:00.134 --> 09:01.104
Yeah.

09:01.274 --> 09:02.574
Right now, people from all across Rikyu...

09:02.574 --> 09:06.704
...who want to be known as the strongest,
have gathered in this city.

09:06.704 --> 09:07.864
Really?

09:09.744 --> 09:11.374
Hey, old man!

09:11.584 --> 09:13.814
You came bumping into me, didn't you?

09:13.814 --> 09:15.814
I now have a broken leg!

09:15.814 --> 09:17.284
How are you going to compensate me?!

09:17.654 --> 09:19.554
Pay up, will you?

09:21.794 --> 09:23.424
Oh, no, a fight.

09:23.424 --> 09:27.334
As I was saying,
this happens all the time here.

09:27.334 --> 09:29.094
The best thing to do is ignore the fight and...

09:29.094 --> 09:30.704
Stop fighting, will you?!

09:30.704 --> 09:31.704
Hey, Reiji!

09:31.704 --> 09:33.894
He hasn't listened to a word I've said.

09:35.674 --> 09:36.634
Who are you?!

09:45.114 --> 09:46.674
What the hell are you doing?!

09:47.114 --> 09:49.104
Your leg's not broken at all!

09:49.214 --> 09:50.154
What?!

09:52.424 --> 09:55.294
What's so fun
about bullying an elderly man?!

09:55.294 --> 09:57.314
Stop picking on the weak!

09:57.624 --> 10:00.464
You certainly have a big mouth, little boy.

10:01.594 --> 10:03.694
That guy.

10:05.134 --> 10:08.104
Hey, Magna, he's our first opponent!

10:08.374 --> 10:09.594
Really?

10:10.844 --> 10:12.304
Is that so?

10:12.304 --> 10:13.904
Is that right?

10:19.844 --> 10:22.714
Little boy, your luck couldn't be worse!

10:22.714 --> 10:26.914
You have to face me,
Unearned-Win King Magna, in the first round!

10:27.454 --> 10:29.024
"Unearned-Win King Magna"?

10:29.024 --> 10:31.024
You mean you win without even fighting?

10:31.024 --> 10:33.064
What a lousy nickname.

10:33.064 --> 10:33.924
Sh-Shut up!

10:34.594 --> 10:37.734
Just let me teach that body of yours...

10:37.734 --> 10:40.604
...why they call me
the Unearned-Win King!

10:41.004 --> 10:42.864
Take this!

10:45.804 --> 10:49.744
I do whatever it takes to win!

10:54.314 --> 10:56.874
That's my aesthetic!

11:00.654 --> 11:01.894
I'm telling ya!

11:01.894 --> 11:04.684
If you can't fight, then don't pick a fight!

11:07.164 --> 11:08.834
Wh-Why, you're...

11:08.834 --> 11:09.994
...Lightning Rockaku!

11:11.264 --> 11:13.534
It's a fight! It's a fight!

11:14.034 --> 11:15.204
- Yeah!
- Get 'em!

11:15.204 --> 11:16.374
E-Excuse me.

11:16.374 --> 11:18.174
- Teach 'em a lesson!
- Fight! Fight!

11:18.174 --> 11:20.044
Oh, no, not Rockaku, too!

11:20.044 --> 11:22.974
At this rate, this really might grow
to involve a hundred!

11:23.174 --> 11:25.884
- C'mon. Make a move.
- What? You wanna fight?

11:25.884 --> 11:27.584
- Yeah!
- Let's do it!

11:27.584 --> 11:28.984
Stop the fight!

11:29.154 --> 11:30.484
I'm against violence!

11:30.484 --> 11:31.574
So am I!

11:54.174 --> 11:55.214
I'm against violence!

11:55.214 --> 11:56.374
Get 'em!

12:00.414 --> 12:01.714
What are these things?!

12:01.954 --> 12:03.974
Not my butt!

12:06.584 --> 12:08.554
I'll getcha for this!

12:11.194 --> 12:13.024
I hope you're not hurt...

12:13.024 --> 12:15.264
...Reiji Ohzora.

12:15.264 --> 12:17.394
How do you know my name?

12:18.864 --> 12:22.464
The truth is, I'm also a participant
in the Dragonic Heaven.

12:25.604 --> 12:28.874
I was impressed with the techniques
you showed at the preliminary match.

12:30.174 --> 12:34.514
I've become a great Reiji Ohzora fan, you see.

12:34.514 --> 12:35.654
Fan?

12:35.654 --> 12:37.174
My name is Taiyou.

12:37.424 --> 12:40.414
I'd be honored if we could get acquainted,
as fellow participants.

12:40.854 --> 12:41.914
Sure thing!

12:42.124 --> 12:43.384
Let's be friends!

12:43.524 --> 12:45.194
I'm Reiji Ohzora!

12:45.194 --> 12:46.124
I know.

12:46.124 --> 12:46.854
Nice to meet you.

12:47.664 --> 12:48.654
Same here.

12:49.294 --> 12:50.694
Nice to meet you.

12:54.504 --> 12:55.474
Chibi.

12:55.634 --> 12:57.974
I wonder what district Taiyou represents.

12:58.644 --> 13:01.134
I should've asked for his team name.

13:06.184 --> 13:07.244
Hey, bro.

13:07.244 --> 13:09.474
They seem to be staying in different rooms.

13:10.514 --> 13:12.684
Must be nice to be able
to afford the luxury.

13:12.684 --> 13:14.524
But right now, each one is alone.

13:14.524 --> 13:16.354
Now's our chance.

13:16.654 --> 13:19.254
I expect full payment, little boy!

13:19.564 --> 13:21.224
Not a problem.

13:21.634 --> 13:23.594
Since he's your first opponent...

13:23.594 --> 13:24.754
...you're killing two birds with one stone.

13:26.404 --> 13:27.364
Quiet.

13:27.364 --> 13:30.774
This is how we won our matches
in the previous tournament!

14:01.174 --> 14:02.104
Maiko?

14:07.844 --> 14:09.474
This is for what you did during the day...

14:09.744 --> 14:11.174
...little boy!

14:12.244 --> 14:14.074
I challenge you to a decisive match!

14:14.284 --> 14:15.154
M-Maiko!

14:15.154 --> 14:16.584
Follow me!

14:17.154 --> 14:18.124
Hey!

14:18.254 --> 14:19.274
Let's go, Chibi!

14:28.164 --> 14:29.294
Where did he go?

14:30.094 --> 14:31.124
Chibi! Over there!

14:38.674 --> 14:39.644
Maiko!

14:42.174 --> 14:44.684
Don't worry. I'll save you in no time.

14:44.684 --> 14:46.404
It won't be so easy!

14:52.454 --> 14:55.254
I'm sorry, but I'm gonna have you
disappear right here.

14:58.694 --> 15:00.994
Damn you! You're not being fair!

15:01.734 --> 15:02.964
Why, thank you.

15:02.964 --> 15:05.304
There's no greater compliment.

15:05.304 --> 15:06.664
To put it simply...

15:06.664 --> 15:11.404
...I don't care what dirty tricks I use,
as long as I get to the top!

15:11.404 --> 15:15.004
Other people's misfortune is my ecstasy!

15:15.244 --> 15:16.734
Put an end to him!

15:24.154 --> 15:26.624
I won't be defeated by these attacks!

15:27.184 --> 15:27.924
Oh, my.

15:27.924 --> 15:29.354
Are you retaliating?

15:29.354 --> 15:31.824
This girl could get hurt, you know.

15:37.334 --> 15:39.694
This is the end, you spoiled brat!

15:42.504 --> 15:43.474
I see.

15:43.774 --> 15:46.464
He's controlling the air pressure
with super low-frequency sonic waves.

15:46.844 --> 15:48.434
T-Taiyou!

15:49.474 --> 15:50.814
I'll fight you!

15:50.814 --> 15:52.314
You're such a fool!

15:52.314 --> 15:54.684
You're planning on fighting
against me with that little dagger?!

15:54.984 --> 15:56.214
That's right!

15:57.154 --> 15:58.714
Lai-Lai Cocoon!

16:13.034 --> 16:14.974
W-Wait! Lai-Lai Cocoon?!

16:14.974 --> 16:16.664
But... it's the real one!

16:23.014 --> 16:25.344
Are you all right, young lady?

16:25.344 --> 16:26.414
Taiyou?

16:26.414 --> 16:28.214
No, you're...

16:28.454 --> 16:29.644
...Sun Wols?!

16:31.424 --> 16:33.784
Taiyou is Sun Wols?

16:33.784 --> 16:35.254
The defending champion?

16:36.124 --> 16:38.594
H-How dare you get in my way?

16:38.594 --> 16:40.224
Even if you are the defending champion...

16:40.224 --> 16:42.354
...anyone who gets in the way
of my happiness...

16:42.564 --> 16:44.404
...has another thing coming!

16:44.404 --> 16:46.924
The only thing that matters
in this world is my own happiness!

16:47.204 --> 16:49.504
Happiness obtained from using others
as stepping stones?!

16:50.104 --> 16:52.304
Such happiness is not true happiness!

16:52.544 --> 16:54.374
You shall vanish!

17:01.054 --> 17:03.214
H-How shocking!

17:09.394 --> 17:10.194
How's that?

17:10.194 --> 17:11.994
Enough to make you reconsider your ways?

17:11.994 --> 17:13.624
Not a chance!

17:13.624 --> 17:16.534
"Reconsider" does not appear
in my dictionary!

17:16.534 --> 17:17.494
Bro...

17:17.664 --> 17:20.464
I guess you need to be taught
another lesson.

17:20.974 --> 17:22.304
Wait, Taiyou!

17:22.304 --> 17:23.234
Reiji?!

17:23.634 --> 17:26.434
My first match is tomorrow morning.

17:26.704 --> 17:28.544
I want to finish this fight fair and square.

17:28.874 --> 17:29.964
Come on, Reiji!

17:30.374 --> 17:32.274
What's the problem? You're safe and unhurt.

17:32.814 --> 17:34.804
I look forward to tomorrow's match!

17:35.314 --> 17:36.804
What confidence.

17:37.314 --> 17:38.524
I'll make you regret that decision!

17:38.524 --> 17:40.814
Huh?! B-Bro!

17:43.294 --> 17:44.254
Reiji.

17:44.364 --> 17:46.954
I can't wait to face off
against you in a real match.

17:47.294 --> 17:48.694
I feel the same way, Taiyou!

17:49.034 --> 17:50.334
Fair and square!

17:50.334 --> 17:51.524
Let's fight a good fight!

17:54.904 --> 17:56.464
We shall meet again!

17:59.704 --> 18:01.074
Wh-What is it, all of a sudden?!

18:01.074 --> 18:04.174
For some reason,
I'm getting really excited!

18:04.174 --> 18:05.444
Yeah? Is that so?

18:05.744 --> 18:08.374
I'm not gonna lose, Taiyou!

18:15.224 --> 18:16.744
Huh? That guy...

18:16.954 --> 18:18.494
Don't look away.

18:18.494 --> 18:19.514
It's beginning.

18:20.094 --> 18:21.394
Where is he?

18:21.394 --> 18:22.724
Isn't that kid here yet?

18:23.294 --> 18:24.164
Your attention please!

18:24.164 --> 18:26.904
It's the start of the tournament
to determine the best dragon master!

18:26.904 --> 18:30.464
We will now commence
the Dragonic Heaven Tournament!

18:31.474 --> 18:34.774
We will begin with the sealing ceremony.

18:41.984 --> 18:43.884
So that's the Dragonite.

18:46.184 --> 18:48.454
Further to this sealing ceremony...

18:49.324 --> 18:52.424
...should even an army attempt to get it...

18:52.424 --> 18:58.164
...nobody but the winner
will be able to touch the Dragonite.

18:58.164 --> 19:00.004
I see.

19:00.004 --> 19:01.904
So that's how they were hiding it.

19:02.374 --> 19:04.704
No wonder I couldn't find it
no matter how much I searched.

19:13.944 --> 19:15.014
Taiyou.

19:15.014 --> 19:16.344
Huh?! Where? Where?

19:17.154 --> 19:18.154
Reiji.

19:18.154 --> 19:20.844
I'm looking forward to my match against you.

19:22.724 --> 19:24.694
I'll try to give it everything I have.

19:25.494 --> 19:30.054
We will now begin our first match!

19:30.594 --> 19:34.004
This match will be conducted
as a one-on-one elimination.

19:34.004 --> 19:37.464
A fight can be won only by a knockout
or by one side giving up.

19:38.174 --> 19:39.604
I'm up first!

19:39.974 --> 19:42.114
All right! You've come prepared, girl!

19:42.114 --> 19:43.374
Hey, Maiko.

19:43.514 --> 19:45.144
You sure you'll be all right?

19:45.144 --> 19:47.444
I can beat those guys alone.

19:47.444 --> 19:49.214
Wait just one moment!

19:52.854 --> 19:54.184
It's Daisuke.

19:54.184 --> 19:56.314
What does he think he's doing here?

19:56.594 --> 19:57.654
Sorry to keep you waiting.

19:57.654 --> 19:59.094
Reiji, Rockaku.

19:59.264 --> 20:00.764
Why are you here?!

20:00.764 --> 20:01.794
Why?

20:01.794 --> 20:03.464
I've come to fight.

20:03.464 --> 20:04.764
I'm doing it!

20:04.764 --> 20:06.394
The injured can watch from the sidelines!

20:06.664 --> 20:07.764
You are, Maiko?

20:08.104 --> 20:09.134
Let's go, Gholaoh.

20:09.134 --> 20:10.074
Why?

20:10.574 --> 20:13.974
Now, what method
shall I use to crush them?

20:13.974 --> 20:14.914
Bro.

20:14.914 --> 20:15.774
Bro!

20:15.774 --> 20:17.244
Stop fussing!

20:17.244 --> 20:18.214
What is it?!

20:18.214 --> 20:19.334
There! There!

20:19.614 --> 20:22.114
"There" doesn't tell me a damn thing.

20:22.114 --> 20:23.744
Oh, no!

20:24.084 --> 20:25.984
Now, let's begin our first match!

20:26.284 --> 20:28.484
D-Break!

20:31.494 --> 20:33.894
Looking good, Maiko!

20:38.864 --> 20:42.164
Awesome, Maiko! That's it!
Get 'em! Get 'em! Maiko!

20:44.004 --> 20:45.904
Fight me, fair and square!

20:45.904 --> 20:47.774
Why should I fight fair?!

20:48.174 --> 20:49.614
I'll get you for this!

20:50.114 --> 20:51.344
Look at that!

20:51.344 --> 20:54.414
Miss Yukino defeats all three opponents
on her own and moves on to the next round!

20:54.414 --> 20:57.384
Could this team become
the dark horse of this tournament?!

20:57.754 --> 20:59.584
So they're our next opponents.

20:59.984 --> 21:01.684
Broadly speaking, they're weak.

21:01.924 --> 21:03.254
They're no match for us.

21:03.254 --> 21:06.654
Whoever our enemy may be,
that Dragonite will be mine.

21:07.094 --> 21:09.254
We finally meet again, Reiji.

21:10.094 --> 21:12.304
The time has come to battle against you.

21:12.304 --> 21:16.674
I look forward to seeing just how much
you'll get my adrenalin flowing.

21:18.704 --> 21:20.674
That was surprisingly easy.

21:20.674 --> 21:24.164
I thought they would put up more of a fight.

21:24.884 --> 21:27.174
I came all the way here for nothing.

21:27.484 --> 21:30.614
Well, the bottom line is
that we've made it to the second round!

21:30.914 --> 21:32.184
There's still a long road ahead of us!

21:32.184 --> 21:33.154
Right!

21:34.254 --> 21:35.224
Taiyou...

21:40.124 --> 21:42.524
...I won't lose, no matter what!

21:57.114 --> 21:59.844
taikutsu datta
I was bored

21:59.844 --> 22:02.614
okubyou datta
I was a coward

22:02.614 --> 22:06.554
dareka wo jibun wo kizutsukete ita
I was hurting someone and myself

22:08.024 --> 22:10.794
tsuyogari itte
I tried to hide my weakness

22:10.794 --> 22:12.954
wagamama itte
I was being selfish

22:13.424 --> 22:17.524
doushiyoumonai kimochi mamoritsuzukete
Protecting the uncontrollable feeling

22:18.964 --> 22:21.634
otona ni natte
I became an adult

22:21.634 --> 22:24.374
kimi to deatte
Then I met you

22:24.374 --> 22:28.334
mune no sumikko yawarakaku natte
My heart got softened

22:29.674 --> 22:32.184
setsunaku natta
Longing for love

22:32.184 --> 22:35.184
dakishime atta
We embraced each other

22:35.184 --> 22:40.054
hakkiri mamorubeki mono wo mitsuketa
I finally knew what I wanted to protect

22:40.724 --> 22:43.454
tatta hitotsu no yuuki ga
Only one courage

22:43.454 --> 22:46.224
tatta hitotsu no kotoba ga
Just one word

22:46.224 --> 22:50.854
futari owaranai yume e to hakobu
Take us to an endless dream

22:51.604 --> 22:54.364
hon no chiisana yasashisa ga
Only a small kindness

22:54.364 --> 22:57.034
hon no wazuka na sasayaki ga
Only a small whisper

22:57.034 --> 23:01.664
futari wo sotto tsutsunde kureru
Wrap us gently

23:02.344 --> 23:06.834
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:07.784 --> 23:13.444
zutto konomama asa ga kurumade
Until the morning comes

23:15.754 --> 23:18.424
Next Episode

23:18.424 --> 23:19.994
Mukai, representing Gizaya.

23:19.994 --> 23:21.494
He looks strong...

23:21.494 --> 23:24.394
...but it's as if there's a story
behind his participation!

23:24.394 --> 23:26.694
Does it have something to do with Guan-Coo?

23:27.704 --> 23:29.204
Even more reason why I can't forgive him!

23:29.204 --> 23:30.304
I'll punish him!

23:30.304 --> 23:33.504
Or so I thought, but I've been caught
in the process, and am I ever in trouble!

23:33.504 --> 23:35.034
Somebody help me!

23:36.114 --> 23:38.744
Next, on Dragon Drive, "Mission".

23:38.744 --> 23:41.784
The person who came to save me was,
surprisingly, that genius dragon master!

23:41.784 --> 23:43.284
Mission
The person who came to save me was,
surprisingly, that genius dragon master!

23:43.284 --> 23:44.384
Mission
His name is!

23:44.384 --> 23:45.354
Mission
